{"item_uid": "指考96-geography-014", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 14, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "過去雲南省的少數民族因私挖亂採礦石，而有浪費資源和破壞環境等問題。最近這種\n情形獲得改善，地方財政收入增加，這是下列何種礦業政策奏效的結果？", "options": {"A": "鼓勵大型企業投資，使礦業規模化", "B": "中央出資收購礦權，轉為國營", "C": "改善個體戶採礦技術，以擴大市場", "D": "關閉礦區，並轉型為其它產業"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "13-14", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 41.0, "B": 35.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 47.0, "B": 34.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 34.0, "B": 36.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 7.0}, "omit_rate": 8.0, "p_value": 41.0, "p_high": 47.0, "p_low": 34.0, "discrimination": 13.0, "p_quintiles": [49.0, 44.0, 42.0, 40.0, 32.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
