{"item_uid": "指考96-geography-026", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 26, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "許多研究指出，地中海東南沿岸漁獲減少與亞斯\n文高壩的興建有關。下列何者為最可能的原因？", "options": {"A": "高壩改變河川地形，造成洄游魚類無法洄游而滅絕 圖 4", "B": "高壩促使水力發電量大，導致地中海浮游生物量降低", "C": "尼羅河兩岸農民使用人工肥料，促使入海水質惡化", "D": "尼羅河兩岸農民施行人工灌溉，致使海水鹽度下降\n- 4 -\n第 5 頁 96年指考\n共 7 頁 地理考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "24-26", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 37.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 28.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 43.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 43.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 8.0, "p_value": 27.0, "p_high": 43.0, "p_low": 14.0, "discrimination": 29.0, "p_quintiles": [48.0, 32.0, 24.0, 17.0, 13.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
